WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,010 --> 00:00:04,090
You guys have been fooled sometimes.

2
00:00:05,960 --> 00:00:07,160
Commander Hui, don’t mind

3
00:00:07,360 --> 00:00:08,360
Just a joke

4
00:00:08,760 --> 00:00:10,760
It seems that Liu Fuchang did not find the wrong person. You are very smart.

5
00:00:10,760 --> 00:00:13,640
It's fitting to be the leader of the four of them. This is the register.

6
00:00:13,640 --> 00:00:14,960
There is personal information about the four of them.

7
00:00:14,960 --> 00:00:18,520
But not yours. Why are you different from them without mine?

8
00:00:18,520 --> 00:00:19,720
Complete erasure of identity information

9
00:00:19,720 --> 00:00:20,720
Already dead to the outside world

10
00:00:20,720 --> 00:00:22,720
And the four of them have already been registered because of their special characteristics.

11
00:00:22,720 --> 00:00:24,920
So the information will remain telling the truth

12
00:00:25,520 --> 00:00:26,520
with your ability

13
00:00:26,520 --> 00:00:27,920
This should also be recorded

14
00:00:28,320 --> 00:00:29,920
All household registrations will not be erased

15
00:00:30,320 --> 00:00:31,520
Just don't know why

16
00:00:31,720 --> 00:00:33,120
No information left at all

17
00:00:33,820 --> 00:00:34,820
If not an actor

18
00:00:35,600 --> 00:00:36,600
I guess I've died

19
00:00:36,600 --> 00:00:38,000
Got the first death row mission

20
00:00:44,900 --> 00:00:46,700
Did you get it wrong that I am a thief?

21
00:00:46,700 --> 00:00:48,100
When did you commit kidnapping?

22
00:00:48,100 --> 00:00:49,300
The last time you stole your breath

23
00:00:49,300 --> 00:00:50,300
Have you ever tied up a child?

24
00:00:50,300 --> 00:00:54,100
I didn't expect that kid to show up. I just tied him up to stop him from yelling. What kind of kidnapping is this?

25
00:00:54,100 --> 00:00:55,300
Then you know you are a thief

26
00:00:55,300 --> 00:00:56,900
Why did you end up in this death row camp?

27
00:00:56,900 --> 00:00:58,100
Could it be possible because of that child?

28
00:00:58,100 --> 00:00:59,900
That kid is the emperor's brother-in-law

29
00:00:59,900 --> 00:01:01,900
Otherwise, you, an ordinary non-thief, wouldn’t be worth it at all.

30
00:01:01,900 --> 00:01:03,300
The person next to you makes a move on you
